        "explanation": "AJAX is a web development technique that allows a web page to request data from a server, receive that data, and update the screen *without reloading the entire page*. \nBefore AJAX, clicking a 'Submit' button or fetching new data resulted in a white flash as the browser re-requested the entire HTML document.",
